    "ruleType": "unit-ability",
    "group": "Hybrid Metamorphs",
    "summary": "During your [Command phase](vsdata:core-rule/command-phase), you may bring back up to D3 of the bearer's unit's **destroyed** models, or up to 3 if that unit is in range of any [objective marker](vsdata:core-rule/level-of-control) you control.\n\n**CHARACTER** models in **Attached units** cannot come back this way. A **[[ONE SHOT]](vsdata:weapon-ability/one-shot)** weapon that a returned model fired before it was destroyed still counts as fired.",
